,"created_at":"2025-04-03T22:13:23Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T22:13:23Z","body":"No problem. Assuming this all makes sense to everyone, this PR would end up superseding that one and this one https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101250, so I think you had the right idea after explaining it. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777108776/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777139457","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104975#issuecomment-2777139457","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104975","id":2777139457,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lh8kB","user":{"login":"SlyZ1","id":40855494,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwODU1NDk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40855494?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlyZ1","html_url":"https://github.com/SlyZ1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlyZ1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlyZ1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlyZ1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlyZ1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlyZ1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlyZ1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlyZ1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlyZ1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SlyZ1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T22:31:19Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T22:31:19Z","body":"Alright so your PR #101251 seems to do all the work for me, and now it works. Should I just copy dumbly your changes or should I do a sort o